# College ERP System - Implementation TODO

Based on SRS v2.1 (MEAN Stack: AngularJS, Node.js, MongoDB)

---

## Phase 1: Foundation

### Authentication and Authorization (AUTH-001 to AUTH-005)
- [ ] AUTH-001: User Registration
  - [ ] Registration form (name, email, password, role)
  - [ ] Email validation
  - [ ] Password minimum 8 characters
  - [ ] Pending state requiring admin approval
  - [ ] Duplicate email rejection
- [ ] AUTH-002: User Login
  - [ ] Login form (email, password)
  - [ ] JWT token generation
  - [ ] Token storage (localStorage/httpOnly cookie)
  - [ ] Token expiration (1 hour default)
  - [ ] Refresh token mechanism
  - [ ] Password reset flow
- [ ] AUTH-003: Password Management
  - [ ] Change password with current verification
  - [ ] Admin force password reset
  - [ ] mustChangePassword flag
  - [ ] Audit trail for password changes
- [ ] AUTH-004: Role-Based Access Control
  - [ ] Six built-in roles: super_admin, college_admin, department_head, faculty, support_staff, student
  - [ ] Custom role creation by super_admin
  - [ ] Permission format: resource:action
  - [ ] Role inheritance
  - [ ] UI element hiding based on permissions
  - [ ] Server-side permission validation
- [ ] AUTH-005: Session Management
  - [ ] JWT access token storage
  - [ ] Refresh token management
  - [ ] Token invalidation on password change
  - [ ] Admin session revocation
  - [ ] Token metadata tracking (IP, user agent)

