## Non-Functional Requirements

### Performance
- [ ] Page loads < 2 seconds
- [ ] Form submissions < 1 second
- [ ] Database indexes on all queries
- [ ] Pagination for large datasets
- [ ] Query optimization

### Security
- [ ] Password hashing with bcrypt (12 rounds)
- [ ] JWT token authentication
- [ ] Input validation (express-validator/Joi)
- [ ] NoSQL injection prevention
- [ ] XSS protection
- [ ] CSRF protection
- [ ] Helmet.js security headers

### UI/UX
- [ ] Responsive design (mobile, tablet, desktop)
- [ ] Bootstrap 4 styling
- [ ] Loading states for async operations
- [ ] Confirmation dialogs for destructive actions
- [ ] Toast notifications for feedback

---

## Database Collections

- [ ] Users (email unique, role indexes)
- [ ] Students (rollNumber unique within department)
- [ ] Faculty
- [ ] Departments (code unique)
- [ ] Courses (code unique within department)
- [ ] Terms (status index)
- [ ] Course Offerings
- [ ] Offering Faculty
- [ ] Course Sessions
- [ ] Enrollments (studentId+offeringId unique)
- [ ] Attendance Records (sessionId+studentId unique)
- [ ] Audit Logs (TTL 90 days)
- [ ] Custom Roles

